   CWE-119 (Improper Restriction of Operations within the Bounds of a Memory Buffer) - High Confidence: Although not directly related to security, this issue can still cause problems. If an attacker can manipulate the `fileName` parameter to read large files, it could lead to denial-of-service (DoS) attacks or information disclosure.

