   CWE-276 (Incorrect Modification of Sensitive Identifiers) - Medium Confidence

4. **Potential Information Disclosure**: The function reads the contents of a file and returns it in an HTTP response without any authentication or authorization checks. This could lead to information disclosure if sensitive data is stored in the files being read.

