Vulnerabilities Found: 3  
CWEs: CWE-611 (Information Exposure through XML External Entity Processing) - High Confidence, CWE-284 (Improper Access Control) - Medium Confidence, CWE-703 (Invalid Error Handling) - Medium Confidence

